<speak>The exact layout can vary with the device and the version you're using, so I wouldn't want to describe a button as if I were seeing your screen. A useful first step is to look for the page heading before moving between sections. If there is a help or support area in the portal, use the guidance shown there for that version. For a persistent navigation issue, the support team can guide you through the relevant screen without you sharing your password or security codes.</speak>